Package: com.ioscaffeinate.cli
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: iOS-Caffeinate contributors <ios-caffeinate@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Bounded power assertion CLI and daemon for rootful iOS
 Native C11 command-line client and manually managed daemon for rootful
 jailbroken iOS 12. The daemon is not started or registered automatically.
